            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">長方形長8cm闊5cm，面積=?</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">常見錯誤</span>
                    <span >8+5=13cm²。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-right">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">正確思路</span>
                    <span >面積=長×闊=8×5=40cm²。周界先係加（8+5+8+5=26cm）！</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-note">💡 面積=乘，周界=加！不要混淆。</div>
